      "zh": "我若在王眼前蒙恩，王若愿意赐我所要的，准我所求的，就请王带着哈曼再赴我所要预备的筵席。明日我必照王所问的说明。」",
      "en": "If I have found favor in the king’s sight and if the king is inclined[NOTE:1] to grant my request and approve my petition, let the king and Haman come tomorrow to the banquet that I will prepare for them. At that time[NOTE:2] I will do as the king wishes.”[NOTE:3]",
